lavender-0991: eMMC (SDHCI, polled PIO) instead of UFS for the ufsroot0 root device

Generated by lavender/tools/emmc_port.py from topaz bsd/dev/sweet_ufs.c (patched tree,
CI run 44412839094). Only the hardware layer changes; read-only unless ufsrw=1.
The topaz touch/keys drivers now need sweethw=1 (SM6225 MMIO).

